<H1>Medium data</H1>
Search for medium no. = [50].
<HR>
Unless otherwise stated, sterilize media by autoclaving at 121&#176;C for 15 min.
<HR>
<P><B><FONT SIZE=3>50&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;OATMEAL AGAR (ISP-3)</FONT></B></P>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Oatmeal (Quaker White Oats)                            </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;20.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Trace salts solution (see below)                        </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Agar                                                   </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;18.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                         </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;1.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> L  </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
Cook or steam 20.0 g of oatmeal in 1.0 L of distilled       water for 20 min. Filter through cheesecloth.       Bring volume back up to 1.0 L and add 1.0 ml of Trace      salt solution. <br>
Adjust pH to 7.2.  <br>
<I>Trace salts solution:</I> <br>
<TABLE BORDER>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> FeSO<sub>4</sub>&#183;7H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> MnCl<sub>2</sub>&#183;4H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> ZnSO<sub>4</sub>&#183;7H<sub>2</sub>O                                  </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;0.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> g  </TD></TR>
<TR><TD WIDTH=75%> Distilled water                                       </TD><TD WIDTH=15% ALIGN=RIGHT><font size=+1><tt>&nbsp;100.0&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</tt></font></TD><TD WIDTH=10% ALIGN=RIGHT> ml        </TD></TR>
</TABLE>
